<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Application Form</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  td { padding: 5px 0; }
  .header-info { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .header-info h1 { font-size: 24pt; margin: 0; }
  .header-info p { margin: 2px 0; font-size: 11pt; }
  .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 12pt; }
  .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .form-row > div { width: 48%; }
  .full-width-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .full-width-row > div { width: 100%; }
  .checkbox-group label { margin-right: 15px; }
  .signature-line { margin-top: 50px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-info">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
      <div>
        <h1 style="font-size: 18pt;">Culver-Stockton College</h1>
        <p>One College Hill</p>
        <p>Canton, MO 63435</p>
        <p>(573) 288-6000</p>
        <p><span data-field="website_url">{{ website_url }}</span></p>
      </div>
      <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="width: 150px;">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">APPLICATION FOR EMPLOYMENT</div>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Return To: Human Resources, One College Hill, Canton, MO 63435</p>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">C-SC is committed to non-discrimination and equal opportunity for all applicants and members of its student body, faculty and staff. It does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, national or ethnic origin, religion, sex, age, disability or other factors prohibited by law.</p>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Please complete all sections of this application completely and honestly. A separate application must be completed for each position for which you are applying.</p>

  <div class="section-title">PERSONAL INFORMATION</div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div>Date of Application: <span data-field="date_of_application">{{ date_of_application }}</span></div>
    <div>Position Applied For: <span data-field="position_applied_for">{{ position_applied_for }}</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div>Name (Last, First, Middle Initial): <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></div>
    <div>Phone Number: <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div>Address (Street, City, State, Zip Code): <span data-field="address">{{ address }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Email Address: <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span></div>

  <div class="section-title">Employment History</div>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">Are you related to anyone employed by Culver-Stockton College? <span data-field="related_to_employee">{{ related_to_employee }}</span> <span data-field="related_to_employee">{{ related_to_employee }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">If yes, list name(s) and relationship(s): <span data-field="related_names">{{ related_names }}</span></p>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">Have you ever been convicted of a misdemeanor or felony other than a minor traffic violation? Any conviction record will not necessarily be a bar to employment, and factors such as age at the time of offense, seriousness and nature of the violation, and rehabilitation will be taken into account. You are not obligated to disclose.</p>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div><label><input type="radio" name="conviction_yes" value="yes"> Yes</label></div>
    <div><label><input type="radio" name="conviction_no" value="no"> No</label></div>
  </div>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">If yes, date of conviction: <span data-field="conviction_date">{{ conviction_date }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">Have you ever had your driving privileges suspended or revoked? <span data-field="driving_suspended">{{ driving_suspended }}</span> <span data-field="driving_suspended">{{ driving_suspended }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">If yes, please explain: <span data-field="driving_explanation">{{ driving_explanation }}</span></p>

  <div class="section-title">Authorization and Agreement</div>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">Are you authorized to be employed in the United States? (If employed, you must show documents that prove your identity and employment eligibility as required by the Immigration Reform and Control Act of 1986.)</p>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div><label><input type="radio" name="authorized_yes" value="yes"> Yes</label></div>
    <div><label><input type="radio" name="authorized_no" value="no"> No</label></div>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">Have you ever been dismissed or asked to resign from a position? <span data-field="dismissed_yes">{{ dismissed_yes }}</span> <span data-field="dismissed_no">{{ dismissed_no }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">Are you on a lay-off or subject to recall? <span data-field="layoff_yes">{{ layoff_yes }}</span> <span data-field="layoff_no">{{ layoff_no }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">Have you applied for employment at C-SC before? <span data-field="applied_before_yes">{{ applied_before_yes }}</span> <span data-field="applied_before_no">{{ applied_before_no }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">If yes, list position(s) and date(s) applied: <span data-field="applied_before_details">{{ applied_before_details }}</span></p>

  <div class="section-title">Availability</div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div>Availability: Full-Time: <span data-field="availability_full_time">{{ availability_full_time }}</span> Part-Time: <span data-field="availability_part_time">{{ availability_part_time }}</span></div>
    <div>Days: <span data-field="availability_days">{{ availability_days }}</span> Evenings: <span data-field="availability_evenings">{{ availability_evenings }}</span> Nights: <span data-field="availability_nights">{{ availability_nights }}</span> Weekends: <span data-field="availability_weekends">{{ availability_weekends }}</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">EDUCATION AND SKILLS:</div>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">List all education beginning with most recent. Indicate a diploma or degree, if completed, including GED if obtained.</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Name of School</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Location of School</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Degree & Major</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">Years Completed</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="education_school_name">{{ education_school_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="education_school_location">{{ education_school_location }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="education_degree_major">{{ education_degree_major }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="education_years_completed">{{ education_years_completed }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="education_school_name_other">{{ education_school_name_other }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="education_school_location_other">{{ education_school_location_other }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="education_degree_major_other">{{ education_degree_major_other }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="education_years_completed_other">{{ education_years_completed_other }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">High School/GED: <span data-field="high_school_ged_details">{{ high_school_ged_details }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Honors Received: <span data-field="honors_received">{{ honors_received }}</span></p>

  <div class="section-title">OFFICE/COMPUTER SKILLS:</div>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">Mark all that you know how to do efficiently.</p>
  <table style="width: 50%;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Keyboarding</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Switchboard</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Word Processing</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Mail/Postage Machine</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Filing</td>
      <td>Data Entry</td>
      <td>Databases</td>
      <td>Internet/Email</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">RELATED SKILLS/CERTIFICATIONS:</div>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">List technical or specialized skills/credentials relevant to this job, certifications, professional licenses, registrations held (include certifications/registration number and expiration date) and knowledge of any computer programming languages or software.</p>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
    <li><span data-field="skill_item_1">{{ skill_item_1 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="skill_item_2">{{ skill_item_2 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="skill_item_3">{{ skill_item_3 }}</span></li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">EMPLOYMENT HISTORY:</div>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">List all employment, including military and volunteer services, starting with the most current position held. Show employment history for at least 10 years or from the time you left school. Use additional sheets as necessary. Please explain gaps in employment history.</p>

  <!-- Employment Entry 1 -->
  <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Position Title: <span data-field="emp_title_1">{{ emp_title_1 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">Dates Employed (month/year): From: <span data-field="emp_dates_from_1">{{ emp_dates_from_1 }}</span> To: <span data-field="emp_dates_to_1">{{ emp_dates_to_1 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 20%;">Salary: <span data-field="emp_salary_1">{{ emp_salary_1 }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Employer Name and Address: <span data-field="emp_employer_name_1">{{ emp_employer_name_1 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">Supervisor's Name/Title: <span data-field="emp_supervisor_name_1">{{ emp_supervisor_name_1 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 20%;">Employment Status: <span data-field="emp_status_1">{{ emp_status_1 }}</span> <span data-field="emp_status_1">{{ emp_status_1 }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 100%;">Briefly Describe Duties: <span data-field="emp_duties_1">{{ emp_duties_1 }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Reason for Leaving: <span data-field="emp_reason_leaving_1">{{ emp_reason_leaving_1 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">May We Contact: <span data-field="emp_contact_yes_1">{{ emp_contact_yes_1 }}</span> <span data-field="emp_contact_no_1">{{ emp_contact_no_1 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 40%;">If Yes: Before Interview: <span data-field="emp_contact_before_1">{{ emp_contact_before_1 }}</span> After Interview: <span data-field="emp_contact_after_1">{{ emp_contact_after_1 }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Employment Entry 2 (Continuation) -->
  <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Position Title: <span data-field="emp_title_2">{{ emp_title_2 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">Dates Employed (month/year): From: <span data-field="emp_dates_from_2">{{ emp_dates_from_2 }}</span> To: <span data-field="emp_dates_to_2">{{ emp_dates_to_2 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 20%;">Salary: <span data-field="emp_salary_2">{{ emp_salary_2 }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Employer Name and Address: <span data-field="emp_employer_name_2">{{ emp_employer_name_2 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">Supervisor's Name/Title: <span data-field="emp_supervisor_name_2">{{ emp_supervisor_name_2 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 20%;">Employment Status: <span data-field="emp_status_2">{{ emp_status_2 }}</span> <span data-field="emp_status_2">{{ emp_status_2 }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 100%;">Briefly Describe Duties: <span data-field="emp_duties_2">{{ emp_duties_2 }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Reason for Leaving: <span data-field="emp_reason_leaving_2">{{ emp_reason_leaving_2 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">May We Contact: <span data-field="emp_contact_yes_2">{{ emp_contact_yes_2 }}</span> <span data-field="emp_contact_no_2">{{ emp_contact_no_2 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 40%;">If Yes: Before Interview: <span data-field="emp_contact_before_2">{{ emp_contact_before_2 }}</span> After Interview: <span data-field="emp_contact_after_2">{{ emp_contact_after_2 }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Employment Entry 3 (Continuation) -->
  <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Position Title: <span data-field="emp_title_3">{{ emp_title_3 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">Dates Employed (month/year): From: <span data-field="emp_dates_from_3">{{ emp_dates_from_3 }}</span> To: <span data-field="emp_dates_to_3">{{ emp_dates_to_3 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 20%;">Salary: <span data-field="emp_salary_3">{{ emp_salary_3 }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Employer Name and Address: <span data-field="emp_employer_name_3">{{ emp_employer_name_3 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">Supervisor's Name/Title: <span data-field="emp_supervisor_name_3">{{ emp_supervisor_name_3 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 20%;">Employment Status: <span data-field="emp_status_3">{{ emp_status_3 }}</span> <span data-field="emp_status_3">{{ emp_status_3 }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 100%;">Briefly Describe Duties: <span data-field="emp_duties_3">{{ emp_duties_3 }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Reason for Leaving: <span data-field="emp_reason_leaving_3">{{ emp_reason_leaving_3 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">May We Contact: <span data-field="emp_contact_yes_3">{{ emp_contact_yes_3 }}</span> <span data-field="emp_contact_no_3">{{ emp_contact_no_3 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 40%;">If Yes: Before Interview: <span data-field="emp_contact_before_3">{{ emp_contact_before_3 }}</span> After Interview: <span data-field="emp_contact_after_3">{{ emp_contact_after_3 }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">PERSONAL REFERENCES:</div>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">List persons familiar with your work performance. Do no list friends, relatives or personal references.</p>

  <!-- Reference 1 -->
  <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Name: <span data-field="ref_name_1">{{ ref_name_1 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">Organization: <span data-field="ref_org_1">{{ ref_org_1 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 20%;">Years Known: <span data-field="ref_years_known_1">{{ ref_years_known_1 }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Title: <span data-field="ref_title_1">{{ ref_title_1 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">Business Address: <span data-field="ref_address_1">{{ ref_address_1 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 20%;">Email Address: <span data-field="ref_email_1">{{ ref_email_1 }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Business Phone Number: <span data-field="ref_phone_1">{{ ref_phone_1 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 100%;">Relationship: <span data-field="ref_relationship_1">{{ ref_relationship_1 }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Reference 2 -->
  <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Name: <span data-field="ref_name_2">{{ ref_name_2 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">Organization: <span data-field="ref_org_2">{{ ref_org_2 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 20%;">Years Known: <span data-field="ref_years_known_2">{{ ref_years_known_2 }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Title: <span data-field="ref_title_2">{{ ref_title_2 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">Business Address: <span data-field="ref_address_2">{{ ref_address_2 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 20%;">Email Address: <span data-field="ref_email_2">{{ ref_email_2 }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Business Phone Number: <span data-field="ref_phone_2">{{ ref_phone_2 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 100%;">Relationship: <span data-field="ref_relationship_2">{{ ref_relationship_2 }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Reference 3 -->
  <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Name: <span data-field="ref_name_3">{{ ref_name_3 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">Organization: <span data-field="ref_org_3">{{ ref_org_3 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 20%;">Years Known: <span data-field="ref_years_known_3">{{ ref_years_known_3 }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Title: <span data-field="ref_title_3">{{ ref_title_3 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">Business Address: <span data-field="ref_address_3">{{ ref_address_3 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 20%;">Email Address: <span data-field="ref_email_3">{{ ref_email_3 }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Business Phone Number: <span data-field="ref_phone_3">{{ ref_phone_3 }}</span></div>
      <div style="width: 100%;">Relationship: <span data-field="ref_relationship_3">{{ ref_relationship_3 }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Why are you interested in this position at Culver-Stockton College?</div>
  <div class="full-width-row">
    <div style="width: 100%;"><span data-field="interest_statement">{{ interest_statement }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">What qualifies you for this position?</div>
  <div class="full-width-row">
    <div style="width: 100%;"><span data-field="qualifications_statement">{{ qualifications_statement }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">What are your career goals?</div>
  <div class="full-width-row">
    <div style="width: 100%;"><span data-field="career_goals">{{ career_goals }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">I understand that Culver-Stockton College follows an "employment at will" policy, in that the employer or I may terminate my employment at any time or for any reasons consistent with applicable federal and state laws. This employment-at-will policy cannot be changed voluntarily or in writing unless authorized by the President of the College. I understand that this employment-at-will policy cannot be changed voluntarily or in writing unless authorized by the President of the College. I understand that this application is not a contract of employment and does not guarantee employment. I understand that the College may request information from my past employers, educational institutions, personal references, and any public or private agencies that have issued me either a professional or vocational certification or license. I also understand that an investigation may include a review of any criminal records. I have provided Culver-Stockton College with true and accurate information and I understand that any misrepresentation or omission of facts in this application, or any subsequent employment, may result in immediate discharge, regardless of when such misrepresentation or omission is discovered.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">I hereby authorize all individuals, schools, and organizations named to provide any information requested about me and hereby release them from all liability for damage in providing this information.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-line">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">Applicant's Signature: _________________________</div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">Date: _________________________</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>